---
description: mmhack project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use `/poteto-mode` (pstack) for any non-trivial change. Prove it works: `pnpm lint && pnpm build`, then hit /api/chat.
- Design: read docs/brand/BRAND.md and docs/brand/MOTION.md before touching UI. Tokens only (src/app/globals.css), no raw hex in components. One accent: `--mm-accent`.
- Secrets live in Vercel env vars only. Never commit .env files.
- No em dashes in copy.
